---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import SocialIcons from '../SocialIcons.astro';
import Title from '../atoms/Title.astro';
import "./about.css"

import About1 from "../../assets/about-img-2.jpg"



---

<section class="section-about py-32" id="section-about">
    <div class="container wrapper">
        <div class="text-center">
            <h2 class="heading-primary">About Me</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
            <h2 class="heading-secondary">this should be a brief bio</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="about-container grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
            <div  class="about-text-1">
                <h3 class="heading-tertiary">Who am I</h3>
                <p>
                    Hi, I am Carbell Kofi Sarfo.
                    <br>
                    I'm Carbell Kofi Sarfo, a creative entrepreneur and content creator, web designer and developer who shares my knowledge and documents my life on my YouTube channel and on my podcast.
                    <br>
                    In addition to creating YouTube content, I serve as a Brand Strategist at <a href="segulaglobal.com">Segula Global</a>. I'm known for my versatility, taking on diverse roles including leadership, graphic design, web development, and more.
                </p>
                <br>
                <p>I don't like to define myself by the work I have done. I define myself by the work towards the goals I am headed. Skills can be taught, personality is inherent. I am addicted to learning, continually challenging myself, and do interesting things that are both aligned and not aligned to my future goals.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-image">
				<Image src={About1} alt="Carbell Sarfo" />
            </div>
            <div class="about-text-2">
                <h3 class="heading-tertiary">Where I am at the Moment</h3>
                <p>Currently, I serve as a Brand Strategist at Segula Global, an executive branding organization that transforms leaders into thought leaders. In this role, I have continued building both hard and soft skills, while gaining valuable leadership abilities.</p>
               
            </div>
            <div class="about-text-3">
                <h3 class="heading-tertiary">Where I am headed</h3>
                <p>I see a future of IT and brands, a future where innovation is a must, a future where business leaders have to be equipped in many disciplines and knowledge background. A future where you have to have a personal brand. And that is the future I am painting.</p>
                <br>
                <p>I am on the journey of discovering the limit to my abilities. To cause a change in someones <strong>THINKING</strong>. To instill in people the believe that "you don't need to be a superhero to be able to do it". Just a simple first step and then figure it on the way.</p>
                <p>In the PDF attachment below, you may learn more about my life, experience, talents, education, and much more.</p>
                <br>
                <a href="./assets/files/Curriculum Vitae (Carbell Sarfo).pdf" target="blank" class="btn btn-red">Download CV</a>
            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>
</section>





<style lang="scss">

	.section-about {
		border-bottom: 1px solid light gray;
	}

///////////////////////////////////////////////
  //             MEDIA QUERIES
  /////////////////////////////////////////////////

@media screen and (min-width: 769px) {
    .section-about {

        .about-text-1 {
            grid-area: aboutText-1;
        }
        .about-text-2 {
            grid-area: aboutText-2;
        }
        .about-text-3 {
            grid-area: aboutText-3;
        }
        .about-image {
            grid-area: aboutImage;
        }
        .about-container {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            grid-template-areas: 
                "aboutText-1 aboutImage"
                "aboutText-2 aboutImage"
                "aboutText-3 aboutImage"
            ;
        }
    }
}


@media screen and (max-width: 500px) {

    .section-about {
        text-align: center;
    }

 
}

</style>